+`App\Actions\CallNextTicket` is invokable and mode-aware
+(`App\Enums\CallMode`: `any`, `priority_only`, `normal_only`). It reads the
+queue state from the database under a row lock (a stale `Queue` instance cannot
+reactivate a queue), rejects an inactive queue with
+`App\Exceptions\InactiveQueueException`, and throws
