+The implementation prevents two concurrent attendants from successfully
+calling the same waiting ticket: the queue row is locked for the transaction,
+the chosen ticket row is locked and re-checked as still `waiting`, and the
+action picks the next candidate if a concurrent `Ticket::call()` won the race.
